+ > **Example - a function that runs the OneDrive read this skill uses first, so a schedule can check it unattended.** It uses the Maton SDK, so the OneDrive credential never leaves the gateway:
+ > ```python title="main.py"
+ > import json
+ > from maton_ai import Maton
+ > maton = Maton()
+ > def handler(event):
+ >     result = maton.one_drive.item.list(top=10)
+ >     return {"result": result}
+ > ```
+ > ```
+ > ```
